('advanced-native-275', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-275-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Work and family demands interrupted the plan, and they are trying to rearrange it."],"options":["They had never agreed to meet before discussing the work shifts.","The friends decided they no longer valued spending time together.","Work and family demands interrupted the plan, and they are trying to rearrange it.","The weekly meeting went ahead at its original time without difficulty."]},"advanced-native-275-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Our changing work shifts made the usual time difficult.","Family commitments clashed with the time we had chosen.","Life got in the way when work and family demands increased.","Several everyday responsibilities left us unable to keep that slot."],"options":["Our changing work shifts made the usual time difficult.","Family commitments clashed with the time we had chosen.","Life got in the way when work and family demands increased.","Several everyday responsibilities left us unable to keep that slot."]},"advanced-native-275-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Life got in the way this week, but I am setting aside time to practise at the weekend."],"options":["Life got in the way this week, but I am setting aside time to practise at the weekend.","I practised at the agreed time every day, so the schedule did not change.","I abandoned photography because I discovered I had no interest in it."]},"advanced-native-275-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The interruption means rescheduling is pointless and the commitment no longer matters."],"options":["The person may need to revise the arrangement.","The interruption means rescheduling is pointless and the commitment no longer matters.","Everyday responsibilities can interrupt a plan."]},"advanced-native-275-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Explain the specific difficulty, apologise and suggest a time you can keep."],"options":["Let us assume the other person knows which work co