('advanced-native-276', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-276-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She treated less experienced learners with respect."],"options":["She treated less experienced learners with respect.","She regarded their questions as beneath her attention.","She accepted only learners who had already mastered the basics.","She avoided giving feedback because beginners could not improve."]},"advanced-native-276-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She treated them as learners worth supporting.","She took their questions seriously.","She did not look down on them for lacking experience.","She gave them patient help with the basics."],"options":["She treated them as learners worth supporting.","She took their questions seriously.","She did not look down on them for lacking experience.","She gave them patient help with the basics."]},"advanced-native-276-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The experienced member looked down on the newcomer for lacking a skill."],"options":["The experienced member gave specific, respectful advice about the next step.","The experienced member looked down on the newcomer for lacking a skill.","The experienced member recognised the newcomer’s value while discussing training needs."]},"advanced-native-276-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A tutor identifies an error, explains it kindly and offers practice."],"options":["A judge dismisses an entrant as inferior without considering the work.","A tutor identifies an error, explains it kindly and offers practice.","A member says a novice is not worth listening to because of their background."]},"advanced-native-276-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The revision request alone does not show contempt; how did the teacher explain it?"],"options":["The extra work alone proves disrespect, regardless of the teacher’s explanation.","The revision request alone does not show contempt; how did the teacher explain it?","Rewrite only to stop further comments, without asking what needs