('advanced-native-277', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-277-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Repeated alerts interrupted the reader’s attention."],"options":["Repeated alerts interrupted the reader’s attention.","The alerts supplied notes that improved the reader’s understanding.","The reader chose a new chapter because the original subject was unfamiliar.","The reader had finished the chapter before any alerts arrived."]},"advanced-native-277-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The alerts were getting in the way of my reading.","The repeated notifications made it harder to stay with the text.","The alerts kept interrupting my attention.","I wanted fewer message interruptions while finishing the chapter."],"options":["The alerts were getting in the way of my reading.","The repeated notifications made it harder to stay with the text.","The alerts kept interrupting my attention.","I wanted fewer message interruptions while finishing the chapter."]},"advanced-native-277-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their pride is getting in the way of an honest conversation."],"options":["Their pride is getting in the way of an honest conversation.","They have already discussed the misunderstanding openly and resolved it.","Their pride is helping them clarify the misunderstanding."]},"advanced-native-277-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A planned quiet period lets the group complete a careful check."],"options":["A planned quiet period lets the group complete a careful check.","Frequent unrelated interruptions break concentration.","An unresolved disagreement prevents members from sharing necessary information."]},"advanced-native-277-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The noise disrupted this attempt; trying in a quieter place may help."],"options":["The noise disrupted this attempt; trying in a quieter place may help.","The interruption shows the text is too advanced, so we should replace it with an easier one.","This interrupted session is enough to conclude tha