('advanced-native-279', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-279-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They deliberately looked for experienced neighbours to ask."],"options":["They had already chosen plants before deciding whom to consult.","They deliberately looked for experienced neighbours to ask.","They came across advice without trying to find anyone.","They waited until a neighbour noticed the balcony problem."]},"advanced-native-279-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I asked around for neighbours with experience.","I sought out experienced gardeners nearby.","I deliberately looked for someone who had grown plants in a small space.","I made an effort to find local people who could advise me."],"options":["I asked around for neighbours with experience.","I sought out experienced gardeners nearby.","I deliberately looked for someone who had grown plants in a small space.","I made an effort to find local people who could advise me."]},"advanced-native-279-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["I sought out long-term residents to learn about the neighbourhood."],"options":["I stumbled upon a resident by chance and had no prior plan to ask.","I sought out long-term residents to learn about the neighbourhood.","I waited for a history account to reach me without looking for anyone."]},"advanced-native-279-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Unexpectedly finding a useful booklet while cleaning a drawer, with no search planned."],"options":["Searching for a specialist who can explain an unfamiliar technique.","Unexpectedly finding a useful booklet while cleaning a drawer, with no search planned.","Making visits to find examples of a local craft."]},"advanced-native-279-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["He looked for those views to understand them; he still needs to assess their reasons."],"options":["He looked for those views to understand them; he still needs to assess their reasons.","Let us treat requesting criticism as accepting each suggested change.","The effort