('advanced-native-280', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-280-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The activity fitted easily into time already available after lunch."],"options":["The activity fitted easily into time already available after lunch.","The speaker planned it but never tried it during the break.","The sketching required the speaker to replace every other lunchtime activity.","The speaker stopped taking lunch breaks to make room for a long class."]},"advanced-native-280-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It slipped naturally into my lunch break.","The short activity matched the gap in my usual routine.","It fitted the quiet time I already had after lunch.","The ten-minute activity fitted the quiet gap I already had after eating."],"options":["It slipped naturally into my lunch break.","The short activity matched the gap in my usual routine.","It fitted the quiet time I already had after lunch.","The ten-minute activity fitted the quiet gap I already had after eating."]},"advanced-native-280-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A little revision has slipped into my usual waiting time."],"options":["A little revision has slipped into my usual waiting time.","Revision has replaced the whole journey with a separate class.","The waiting period remains unused because I have not begun revising."]},"advanced-native-280-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A proposed activity remains outside the routine because no time has been found for it."],"options":["A useful tool becomes an ordinary part of preparing the daily journey.","A proposed activity remains outside the routine because no time has been found for it.","A short habit becomes a regular part of an existing break."]},"advanced-native-280-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It can fit easily into the break, and keeping the materials ready can still help."],"options":["It can fit easily into the break, and keeping the materials ready can still help.","Its short duration means we can skip arranging the m