('advanced-native-281', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-281-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They made an unplanned decision after noticing it was open."],"options":["They had reserved the whole afternoon for it several weeks earlier.","They made an unplanned decision after noticing it was open.","They had planned it but cancelled after seeing the opening hours.","They entered only because the earlier booking required it."]},"advanced-native-281-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["No, the idea came to us as we were passing.","No, we chose to go in only after seeing it was open.","No, it was not part of the plan we started with.","No, we decided on the spur of the moment."],"options":["No, the idea came to us as we were passing.","No, we chose to go in only after seeing it was open.","No, it was not part of the plan we started with.","No, we decided on the spur of the moment."]},"advanced-native-281-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We decided on the spur of the moment to watch the performance."],"options":["We kept our earlier booking for the performance despite planning to leave.","We had scheduled this performance before arranging the walk.","We decided on the spur of the moment to watch the performance."]},"advanced-native-281-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The exact activity had been booked and agreed a month earlier."],"options":["The choice was first made while they were already nearby.","They had not intended to do it earlier that day.","The exact activity had been booked and agreed a month earlier."]},"advanced-native-281-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It tells us the decision was unplanned, not whether the outcome was good or bad."],"options":["It tells us the decision was unplanned, not whether the outcome was good or bad.","Let us judge the outcome from the timing of the decision alone.","It must have been an accident rather than a choice, since it was not planned."]},"advanced-native-281-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We decided on the spur of the moment to cook together after the neighbour brought fresh vegetables.","Cooking had not been in our plan, but we chose on the spur of the moment to make dinner with the vegetables we had just received."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-282', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-282-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They use it regularly to coordinate ordinary activities."],"options":["They stopped using it before it could affect the morning routine.","They saw an advertisement but have not tried the calendar.","They use it for a one-off demonstration unrelated to their plans.","They use it regularly to coordinate ordinary activities."]},"advanced-native-282-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They check it every morning before arranging the day.","Daily coordination of school and work shows it is embedded in their daily life.","It regularly connects their school, work and family plans.","They depend on the routine of checking it together."],"options":["They check it every morning before arranging the day.","Daily coordination of school and work shows it is embedded in their daily life.","It regularly connects their school, work and family plans.","They depend on the routine of checking it together."]},"advanced-native-282-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The recording practice is embedded in their daily life."],"options":["Its only role was a single demonstration before the students abandoned it.","The recording practice is embedded in their daily life.","The practice remains an unused idea from the introductory session."]},"advanced-native-282-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A display introduces the tool once, with no evidence of later use."],"options":["People use the practice in several ordinary routines.","A display introduces the tool once, with no evidence of later use.","The activity is a familiar part of daily preparation."]},"advanced-native-282-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["How do people actually use it in their ordinary routines?"],"options":["The frequency of the adverts establishes how often people actually use it.","A single trial is enough to establish that the tool is part of a regular routine.","How do people actually use it in their ordinary rou