('advanced-native-283', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-283-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker still uses a habit learned from the coach years later."],"options":["The speaker forgot the advice immediately after the lesson.","The coach’s advice was planned but never given.","The coach made a brief impression, but the speaker soon stopped using the discussion habit.","The speaker still uses a habit learned from the coach years later."]},"advanced-native-283-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her guidance continues to shape how I answer opposing views.","She left a strong mark: I still consider opposing views as she taught me.","I have carried her patient approach into later conversations.","I still use the discussion habit she taught me years ago."],"options":["Her guidance continues to shape how I answer opposing views.","She left a strong mark: I still consider opposing views as she taught me.","I have carried her patient approach into later conversations.","I still use the discussion habit she taught me years ago."]},"advanced-native-283-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The experience left a strong mark on how I plan community projects."],"options":["The experience remains only a proposal I have not taken part in.","The experience left a strong mark on how I plan community projects.","The experience held my attention briefly but had no later effect on my planning."]},"advanced-native-283-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The effect must be the only cause of everything the person later does."],"options":["The lasting effect may be helpful or harmful depending on the experience.","A later habit can be evidence of a lasting effect.","The effect must be the only cause of everything the person later does."]},"advanced-native-283-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may still influence you, but new experiences can also change your approach."],"options":["Decline the new opportunity without finding out whether it differs from the old one.","Ke