('advanced-native-288', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-288-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It helped the speaker slow down and enjoy a quiet pause."],"options":["It helped the speaker slow down and enjoy a quiet pause.","The speaker already felt calm before entering, so the courtyard brought no change.","It persuaded the speaker that everyone would react in the same way.","It made the speaker rush to finish more tasks."]},"advanced-native-288-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It worked its magic and left me feeling calmer.","I enjoyed sitting there without the afternoon rush.","Its quiet setting helped me slow down.","The plants and quiet gave me a pleasant pause."],"options":["It worked its magic and left me feeling calmer.","I enjoyed sitting there without the afternoon rush.","Its quiet setting helped me slow down.","The plants and quiet gave me a pleasant pause."]},"advanced-native-288-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her careful design worked its magic on the old fabric."],"options":["The design left the fabric unchanged, with no bag being made.","The finished design made the old fabric less appealing to the observer.","Her careful design worked its magic on the old fabric."]},"advanced-native-288-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["It establishes that the same effect will occur for every person without exception."],"options":["It may describe a setting or a person’s skilled work.","It establishes that the same effect will occur for every person without exception.","It can praise a noticeable positive effect."]},"advanced-native-288-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It created a lovely effect for us, but other viewers may respond differently."],"options":["It created a lovely effect for us, but other viewers may respond differently.","A different response from another viewer would make our own positive experience false.","Our response is enough to establish how the other viewers felt."]},"advanced-native-288-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers"